WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_05h.avi - Reaching for Rinoa
Duration: approximately 7 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Two figures float in the infinite darkness of space, drawing closer. Squall extends one arm toward Rinoa, his gloved hand outstretched, reaching across the void. Rinoa's limp body drifts toward him, her own arm floating passively. Their hands stretch toward each other — gloved fingers separated by a diminishing distance. The moment is poignant and desperate, a critical point of connection between two souls in the vastness of space. Stars glitter around them, emphasizing both the isolation and the profundity of this rescue. The camera closes in on the space between their reaching hands, building tension as they approach each other.
